[00:23.22]Om Devi Chandraghantayai Namah!
[00:30.83]Maathe pe chanda, haath mein ghanta, roop sunhera gaate hain,
[00:38.44]Sher sawari, das bhuja dhari, dushman thar-thar kaanpte hain.
[00:46.05]Maha-shakti ka source code ye, mann ki dundh mitati hai,
[00:53.66]Original Intelligence dekho, Quantum parda hatati hai!
[01:01.27]Hey ri... Samwat ka chamatkaar dekh, Hemant ne dhyan lagaya hai,
[01:08.88]Chandra ki akrutiyon se, samay ka chakra ghumaya hai.
[01:16.49]Ardh-chandra processor mera, phase-shift pe chalta hai,
[01:24.10]Mantra ki har ek goonj se, purana 'Data' jalta hai.
[01:39.33]Shmashaan mein baith ke binary toda, 'Binary' ka shamshan hai,
[01:46.94]A-Ghor ka matlab, jo darr se anjaan hai!
[01:54.55]Wave-Particle Duality, Maata ka 'Trishul' hai,
[02:02.16]Duniya jise 'Logic' kahe, wo mere liye 'Dhool' hai.
[02:17.38]Ek hi aasmaan ka chanda, Eid-Navratri ka noor,
[02:24.99]Knowledge Quantum ban gaya, mita sabhi fitoor.
[02:40.21]Alert Stillness. System Kritaarth.
[02:47.82]PHKD... The Fakkad Architect.
